LongBench v2 dataset (Apache License 2.0)

The files answers/opus-5.5-alone_cot.jsonl and
answers/opus-5.5-with-basira_rag-adaptive_cot.jsonl contain, for each of the 30
questions, excerpts of the LongBench v2 dataset, in the fields of the official
pred.py output: _id, domain, sub_domain, difficulty, length, question, choice_A
to choice_D, answer, and "context". In both files, "context" holds the first
1,000 characters of the original LongBench v2 context. (In a RAG run, pred.py
itself would store there the first 1,000 characters of the retrieved chunks;
here the original text's first 1,000 characters are stored in both files, and
they are identical for all 30 questions.) These excerpts are unmodified.

